omatoes, lentils, and stock.","Bring to a simmer and cook for 20-25 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the lentils are soft.","Blend if you'd like it smooth, or leave as is. Season to taste and serve with bread."],"servings":2},{"title":"Chicken Noodle Soup","category":"Soup","time":25,"teaser":"A comforting classic that comes together with shop-bought stock and leftover or quick-cooked chicken.","ingredients":[{"qty":1,"unit":"litre","item":"chicken stock"},{"qty":150,"unit":"g","item":"cooked chicken, shredded (or 1 raw breast, sliced thin)"},{"qty":100,"unit":"g","item":"dried noodles or vermicelli"},{"qty":1,"unit":null,"item":"carrot, sliced"},{"qty":1,"unit":"stick","item":"celery, sliced"},{"qty":1,"unit":"tsp","item":"dried thyme"}],"steps":["Bring the stock to a simmer in a large pot.","Add the carrot and celery and cook for 5 minutes.","Add the chicken (raw or cooked) and thyme, and simmer for 8-10 minutes until the chicken is cooked through.","Add the noodles for the last 3-4 minutes of cooking, until tender. Season and serve."],"servings":2},{"title":"Creamy Broccoli & Potato Soup","category":"Soup","time":30,"teaser":"Blended into velvety smoothness — good for using up an ageing head of broccoli.","ingredients":[{"qty":1,"unit":"head","item":"broccoli, chopped"},{"qty":2,"unit":null,"item":"potatoes, peeled and chopped"},{"qty":1,"unit":null,"item":"onion, diced"},{"qty":800,"unit":"ml","item":"vegetable stock"},{"qty":100,"unit":"ml","item":"cream (optional)"},{"qty":null,"unit":null,"item":"Olive oil"}],"steps":["Heat oil in a pot and soften the onion for 4 minutes.","Add the potatoes and stock, bring to a simmer, and cook for 10 minutes.","Add the broccoli and cook for a further 8-10 minutes until everything is tender.","Blend until smooth, stir in the cream if using, and season to taste."],"servings":2},{"title":"Spiced Carrot & Ginger Soup","category":"Soup","time":30,"teaser":"Naturally sweet and warming, with just a handful of ingredients.","i