l smooth, stir in the cream if using, and season to taste.","Serve with crusty bread."],"servings":2},{"title":"Spicy Black Bean Soup","category":"Soup","time":25,"teaser":"A store-cupboard soup that gets its kick from chilli and smoked paprika.","ingredients":[{"qty":2,"unit":"tins","item":"black beans, drained and rinsed"},{"qty":1,"unit":null,"item":"onion, diced"},{"qty":2,"unit":"cloves","item":"garlic, minced"},{"qty":1,"unit":"tsp","item":"ground cumin"},{"qty":1,"unit":"tsp","item":"smoked paprika"},{"qty":0.5,"unit":"tsp","item":"chilli powder"},{"qty":700,"unit":"ml","item":"vegetable stock"},{"qty":null,"unit":null,"item":"Lime juice and chopped coriander to serve"},{"qty":null,"unit":null,"item":"Olive oil"}],"steps":["Heat oil in a pot and soften the onion and garlic for 4-5 minutes.","Add the cumin, smoked paprika, and chilli powder, and cook for 30 seconds.","Add the black beans and stock, and simmer for 15 minutes.","Blend partially for a thicker texture if you like, and season to taste.","Serve with a squeeze of lime and chopped coriander."],"servings":2},{"title":"Roasted Red Pepper & Tomato Soup","category":"Soup","time":30,"teaser":"Roasted peppers and tomatoes blended into a smoky, comforting soup.","ingredients":[{"qty":3,"unit":"red","item":"peppers, halved and deseeded"},{"qty":1,"unit":"tin","item":"(400g) chopped tomatoes"},{"qty":1,"unit":null,"item":"onion, diced"},{"qty":2,"unit":"cloves","item":"garlic, minced"},{"qty":700,"unit":"ml","item":"vegetable stock"},{"qty":1,"unit":"tsp","item":"smoked paprika"},{"qty":null,"unit":null,"item":"Olive oil"}],"steps":["Preheat the oven to 200°C (fan 180°C).","Roast the peppers, cut-side down, with a drizzle of oil for 20 minutes until softened and lightly charred. Roughly chop.","Meanwhile, soften the onion and garlic in a pot for 4-5 minutes.","Add the roasted peppers, tomatoes, smoked paprika, and stock.","Simmer for 10-15 minutes, then blend until smooth. Season to taste."],"servings":2},{"ti