l the prawns are pink and cooked through.","Ladle into bowls and top with spring onion and a squeeze of lime."],"servings":2},{"title":"Butternut Squash & Sage Soup","category":"Soup","time":30,"teaser":"A silky, warming soup that's ready in half an hour with just a handful of ingredients.","ingredients":[{"qty":1,"unit":"tbsp","item":"olive oil"},{"qty":1,"unit":null,"item":"onion, diced"},{"qty":2,"unit":"cloves","item":"garlic, minced"},{"qty":600,"unit":"g","item":"butternut squash, peeled and cubed"},{"qty":750,"unit":"ml","item":"vegetable stock"},{"qty":6,"unit":null,"item":"fresh sage leaves"},{"qty":100,"unit":"ml","item":"double cream"},{"qty":null,"unit":null,"item":"Salt and black pepper"}],"steps":["Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat and cook the onion until soft, about 5 minutes.","Add the garlic and sage leaves and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.","Add the butternut squash and vegetable stock, bring to a boil, then simmer for 18-20 minutes until the squash is tender.","Blend the soup until smooth using a stick blender.","Stir in the cream, season with salt and pepper, and serve warm."],"servings":2},{"title":"Spicy Chicken Tortilla Soup","category":"Soup","time":30,"teaser":"A smoky, chilli-spiked broth with shredded chicken, black beans, and sweetcorn, topped with crunchy tortilla chips.","ingredients":[{"qty":1,"unit":"tbsp","item":"olive oil"},{"qty":1,"unit":null,"item":"onion, diced"},{"qty":2,"unit":"cloves","item":"garlic, minced"},{"qty":1,"unit":null,"item":"red chilli, finely chopped"},{"qty":1,"unit":"tsp","item":"ground cumin"},{"qty":1,"unit":"tsp","item":"smoked paprika"},{"qty":400,"unit":"g","item":"tin chopped tomatoes"},{"qty":700,"unit":"ml","item":"chicken stock"},{"qty":2,"unit":null,"item":"chicken breasts"},{"qty":400,"unit":"g","item":"tin black beans, drained"},{"qty":150,"unit":"g","item":"sweetcorn"},{"qty":null,"unit":null,"item":"Juice of 1 lime"},{"qty":null,"unit":null,"item":"Tortilla chips, to serve"},{"qty":null,"unit":null,"item":"Salt and black pepper"}],"steps":["Heat the oil in a large pot over medium heat and cook the onion for 4-5 minutes until softened.","Add the garlic, chilli, cumin, and smoked paprika, and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.","Stir in the chopped tomatoes and chicken stock, then add the chicken breasts whole. Bring to a simmer and cook for 15-18 minutes until the chicken is cooked through.","Remove the chicken, shred with two forks, and return to the pot along with the black beans and sweetcorn. Simmer for 5 minutes.","Stir in the lime juice, season to taste, and serve topped with tortilla chips."],"servings":2},{"title":"Thai Coconut Chicken Soup","category":"Soup","time":25,"teaser":"A fragrant coconut broth with tender chicken, ready in under half an hour.","ingredients":[{"qty":2,"unit":"chicken","item":"breasts, sliced"},{"qty":1,"unit":"tin","item":"(400ml) coconut milk"},{"qty":700,"unit":"ml","item":"chicken stock"},{"qty":1,"unit":"thumb","item":"ginger, grated"},{"qty":2,"unit":"tbsp","item":"Thai red curry paste"},{"qty":1,"unit":"tbsp","item":"fish sauce"},{"qty":1,"unit":null,"item":"lime, juiced"},{"qty":null,"unit":null,"item":"Handful fresh coriander, to serve"}],"steps":["Bring the stock to a simmer in a large pot with the ginger and curry paste.","Pour in the coconut milk and simmer for 5 minutes.","Add the chicken and cook for 8-10 minutes until cooked through.","Stir in the fish sauce and lime juice.","Ladle into bowls and top with coriander."],"servings":2},{"title":"Spicy Sausage & Butter Bean Soup","category":"Soup","time":30,"teaser":"A warming, one-pot soup that turns a pack of sausages and a tin of beans into a full meal.","ingredients":[{"qty":6,"unit":null,"item":"sausages"},{"qty":1,"unit":"tin","item":"butter beans, drained and rinsed"},{"qty":1,"unit":null,"item":"onion, diced"},{"qty":2,"unit":"cloves","item":"garlic, minced"},{"qty":1,"unit":"tin","item":"(400g) chopped tomatoes"},{"qty":700,"unit":"ml",