":"tbsp","item":"soured cream"},{"qty":null,"unit":null,"item":"Handful lettuce, shredded"}],"steps":["Toss the chicken with the fajita seasoning and a little oil.","Fry in a hot pan for 6-8 minutes until cooked through and lightly charred.","Warm the tortillas and the rice and black beans separately.","Layer the rice, black beans, chicken, cheddar, and lettuce onto the wraps.","Top with soured cream, roll up tightly, and slice in half to serve."],"servings":2},{"title":"Greek-Style Salad with Feta","category":"Salad","time":15,"teaser":"A fresh, no-cook option for a hot evening.","ingredients":[{"qty":1,"unit":null,"item":"cucumber, chopped"},{"qty":3,"unit":null,"item":"tomatoes, chopped"},{"qty":1,"unit":"red","item":"onion, thinly sliced"},{"qty":100,"unit":"g","item":"feta, cubed"},{"qty":null,"unit":null,"item":"Handful olives"},{"qty":2,"unit":"tbsp","item":"olive oil"},{"qty":1,"unit":"tbsp","item":"red wine vinegar"}],"steps":["Combine the cucumber, tomatoes, and onion in a large bowl.","Scatter the feta and olives over the top.","Whisk the olive oil and vinegar together and drizzle over the salad.","Toss gently and serve with warm pitta or bread."],"servings":2},{"title":"Chicken Caesar Salad","category":"Salad","time":20,"teaser":"A heartier, main-course version of the classic side salad.","ingredients":[{"qty":2,"unit":"chicken","item":"breasts"},{"qty":1,"unit":"romaine","item":"or cos lettuce, chopped"},{"qty":4,"unit":"tbsp","item":"caesar dressing"},{"qty":3,"unit":"tbsp","item":"parmesan, grated"},{"qty":null,"unit":null,"item":"Handful croutons"}],"steps":["Season the chicken and pan-fry or grill until cooked through, then slice.","Toss the lettuce with the caesar dressing in a large bowl.","Top with the sliced chicken, parmesan, and croutons.","Serve immediately while the croutons are still crisp."],"servings":2},{"title":"Warm Potato & Bacon Salad","category":"Salad","time":25,"teaser":"New potatoes and crispy bacon in a light mustard dressing, b